class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170905182810&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Obsidian_Knife_8371dd.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an obsidian knife.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Sharp and light, this is a useful tool for tanners, doctors and assassins.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>An Obsidian Knife is mainly used for getting different types of leather from the dead bodies of certain <a href=\"#/wiki/Skinning\">creatures</a>, such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaurs\">Minotaurs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizards\">Lizards</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonebeast\">Bonebeasts</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoths</a> and some bosses.\nUsing an <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Obsidian Knife</strong> you can :\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Skinning\">Skin</a> several <a href=\"#/wiki/Skinning\">creatures</a> (See also <a href=\"#/wiki/Blessed%20Wooden%20Stake\">Blessed Wooden Stake</a>).</li>\n<li>Carve <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Mammoth\">Ice Sculptures</a> from an <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Cube\">Ice cube</a>.</li>\n<li>Carve Raw Watermelon Tourmaline.</li>\n<li>Disassemble Fireworks Rockets to their respective components.</li></ul>\n<p>Item obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/obsidian-knife-quest\">Obsidian Knife Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/an-interest-in-botany-quest\">An Interest In Botany Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/an-uneasy-alliance-quest\">An Uneasy Alliance Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-outfits-quest\">Barbarian Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Beautiful%20Marble%20Statue\">Beautiful Marble Statue</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blessed%20Wooden%20Stake\">Blessed Wooden Stake</a></li><li>Blue Fireworks Rocket</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\">Candy Cane</a></li><li>Cold as Ice</li><li>Colourful Fireworks Rocket</li><li>Constructions</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crocodile%20Steak\">Crocodile Steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/elemental-spheres-quest\">Elemental Spheres Quest</a></li><